@command
Feature: 進入後台管理介面 # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:2

  @command
  Feature: 進入後台管理介面  # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:2

  Rule: 前置（身份）- 只有擁有者可以進入後台（密碼登入 + JWT）  # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:9

  Rule: 前置（參數）- 密碼為必填，未提供時回傳 400 Bad Request  # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:12

    Example: 密碼為空時拒絕登入                                # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:14
      Given 擁有者憑證為：                                   # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 0               | null         |
      When 擁有者登入後台：                                   # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/login.py:7
        | password |
        | ""       |
      Then 操作失敗，狀態碼為 400，錯誤代碼為 "REQUIRED_FIELD_EMPTY" # tests/features/steps/common_then/failure.py:4

  Rule: 前置（鎖定）- 連續密碼錯誤 5 次後鎖定 15 分鐘，鎖定期間一律回傳 429 Too Many Requests  # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:20

    Example: 第 5 次密碼錯誤時觸發鎖定                       # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:22
      Given 擁有者憑證為：                               # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 0               | null         |
      Given 擁有者憑證為：                               # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 4               | null         |
      When 擁有者登入後台：                               # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/login.py:7
        | password   |
        | WrongPass1 |
      Then 操作失敗，狀態碼為 401，錯誤代碼為 "INVALID_PASSWORD" # tests/features/steps/common_then/failure.py:4
      And 擁有者憑證應為：                                # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_then/owner_credential.py:7
        | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | 5               | now+15m      |

    Scenario Outline: 鎖定期間不論密碼正確與否一律拒絕 -- @1.1   # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:45
      Given 擁有者憑證為：                              # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 0               | null         |
      Given 擁有者憑證為：                              # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 5               | now+10m      |
      When 擁有者登入後台：                              # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/login.py:7
        | password   |
        | Orbit#2026 |
      Then 操作失敗，狀態碼為 429，錯誤代碼為 "LOGIN_LOCKED"    # tests/features/steps/common_then/failure.py:4

    Scenario Outline: 鎖定期間不論密碼正確與否一律拒絕 -- @1.2   # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:46
      Given 擁有者憑證為：                              # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 0               | null         |
      Given 擁有者憑證為：                              # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 5               | now+10m      |
      When 擁有者登入後台：                              # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/login.py:7
        | password   |
        | WrongPass1 |
      Then 操作失敗，狀態碼為 429，錯誤代碼為 "LOGIN_LOCKED"    # tests/features/steps/common_then/failure.py:4

    Example: 鎖定到期後可用正確密碼登入  # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:48
      Given 擁有者憑證為：         # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 0               | null         |
      Given 擁有者憑證為：         # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 5               | now-1m       |
      When 擁有者登入後台：         # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/login.py:7
        | password   |
        | Orbit#2026 |
      Then 操作成功             # tests/features/steps/common_then/success.py:4
      And 擁有者憑證應為：          # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_then/owner_credential.py:7
        | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | 0               | null         |

    Example: 鎖定到期後錯誤計數從 0 重新起算                    # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:60
      Given 擁有者憑證為：                               # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 0               | null         |
      Given 擁有者憑證為：                               # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 5               | now-1m       |
      When 擁有者登入後台：                               # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/login.py:7
        | password   |
        | WrongPass1 |
      Then 操作失敗，狀態碼為 401，錯誤代碼為 "INVALID_PASSWORD" # tests/features/steps/common_then/failure.py:4
      And 擁有者憑證應為：                                # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_then/owner_credential.py:7
        | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | 1               | null         |

  Rule: 後置（狀態）- 密碼正確後發放 JWT（有效期 24 小時），可看到後台管理介面  # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:72

    Example: 密碼正確時發放 24 小時 JWT  # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:75
      Given 擁有者憑證為：             # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 0               | null         |
      When 擁有者登入後台：             # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/login.py:7
        | password   |
        | Orbit#2026 |
      Then 操作成功                 # tests/features/steps/common_then/success.py:4
      And 回應應包含有效期 24 小時的 JWT   # tests/features/steps/auth/readmodel_then/jwt_token.py:9
      And 擁有者憑證應為：              # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_then/owner_credential.py:7
        | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | 0               | null         |

  Rule: 後置（狀態）- 登入成功後連續錯誤次數歸零  # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:85

    Example: 有錯誤紀錄時登入成功後歸零  # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:87
      Given 擁有者憑證為：         # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 0               | null         |
      Given 擁有者憑證為：         # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 3               | null         |
      When 擁有者登入後台：         # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/login.py:7
        | password   |
        | Orbit#2026 |
      Then 操作成功             # tests/features/steps/common_then/success.py:4
      And 擁有者憑證應為：          # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_then/owner_credential.py:7
        | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | 0               | null         |

  Rule: 後置（錯誤）- 密碼錯誤時拒絕進入，回傳 401 Unauthorized  # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:99

    Example: 密碼錯誤時拒絕並累計錯誤次數                       # tests/features/admin/auth/進入後台.feature:101
      Given 擁有者憑證為：                               # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/owner_credential.py:11
        | password   | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | Orbit#2026 | 0               | null         |
      When 擁有者登入後台：                               # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/login.py:7
        | password   |
        | WrongPass1 |
      Then 操作失敗，狀態碼為 401，錯誤代碼為 "INVALID_PASSWORD" # tests/features/steps/common_then/failure.py:4
      And 擁有者憑證應為：                                # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_then/owner_credential.py:7
        | failed_attempts | locked_until |
        | 1               | null         |

@command
Feature: 刪除段落 # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:2

  @command
  Feature: 刪除段落  # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:2

  Rule: 前置（身份）- 未帶 JWT 或 JWT 無效／過期（有效期 24 小時）時拒絕操作，回傳 401 Unauthorized  # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:17

    Scenario Outline: JWT 為「未帶」時拒絕刪除 -- @1.1   # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:26
      Given 擁有者已登入                             # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/logged_in.py:11
      And 系統中有以下衛星：                            # tests/features/steps/satellite/aggregate_given/satellites.py:8
        | name | created_at       |
        | 天文   | 2026-01-01 00:00 |
      And 系統中有以下子衛星：                           # tests/features/steps/sub_satellite/aggregate_given/sub_satellites.py:8
        | satellite_id | name | created_at       |
        | $天文.id       | 星系   | 2026-02-01 00:00 |
      And 系統中有以下段落：                            # tests/features/steps/paragraph/aggregate_given/paragraphs.py:8
        | sub_satellite_id | title | content            | created_at       |
        | $星系.id           | 銀河系簡介 | <p>銀河系是一個棒旋星系。</p> | 2026-03-01 00:00 |
        | $星系.id           | 太陽系簡介 | <p>太陽系有八大行星。</p>   | 2026-03-02 00:00 |
      Given 擁有者的 JWT 狀態為 "未帶"                  # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/jwt_state.py:4
      When 擁有者刪除段落 "$太陽系簡介.id"                 # tests/features/steps/paragraph/commands/delete_paragraph.py:7
      Then 操作失敗，狀態碼為 401，錯誤代碼為 "UNAUTHORIZED"  # tests/features/steps/common_then/failure.py:4

    Scenario Outline: JWT 為「已過期」時拒絕刪除 -- @1.2   # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:27
      Given 擁有者已登入                              # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/logged_in.py:11
      And 系統中有以下衛星：                             # tests/features/steps/satellite/aggregate_given/satellites.py:8
        | name | created_at       |
        | 天文   | 2026-01-01 00:00 |
      And 系統中有以下子衛星：                            # tests/features/steps/sub_satellite/aggregate_given/sub_satellites.py:8
        | satellite_id | name | created_at       |
        | $天文.id       | 星系   | 2026-02-01 00:00 |
      And 系統中有以下段落：                             # tests/features/steps/paragraph/aggregate_given/paragraphs.py:8
        | sub_satellite_id | title | content            | created_at       |
        | $星系.id           | 銀河系簡介 | <p>銀河系是一個棒旋星系。</p> | 2026-03-01 00:00 |
        | $星系.id           | 太陽系簡介 | <p>太陽系有八大行星。</p>   | 2026-03-02 00:00 |
      Given 擁有者的 JWT 狀態為 "已過期"                  # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/jwt_state.py:4
      When 擁有者刪除段落 "$太陽系簡介.id"                  # tests/features/steps/paragraph/commands/delete_paragraph.py:7
      Then 操作失敗，狀態碼為 401，錯誤代碼為 "UNAUTHORIZED"   # tests/features/steps/common_then/failure.py:4

    Scenario Outline: JWT 為「無效」時拒絕刪除 -- @1.3   # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:28
      Given 擁有者已登入                             # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/logged_in.py:11
      And 系統中有以下衛星：                            # tests/features/steps/satellite/aggregate_given/satellites.py:8
        | name | created_at       |
        | 天文   | 2026-01-01 00:00 |
      And 系統中有以下子衛星：                           # tests/features/steps/sub_satellite/aggregate_given/sub_satellites.py:8
        | satellite_id | name | created_at       |
        | $天文.id       | 星系   | 2026-02-01 00:00 |
      And 系統中有以下段落：                            # tests/features/steps/paragraph/aggregate_given/paragraphs.py:8
        | sub_satellite_id | title | content            | created_at       |
        | $星系.id           | 銀河系簡介 | <p>銀河系是一個棒旋星系。</p> | 2026-03-01 00:00 |
        | $星系.id           | 太陽系簡介 | <p>太陽系有八大行星。</p>   | 2026-03-02 00:00 |
      Given 擁有者的 JWT 狀態為 "無效"                  # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/jwt_state.py:4
      When 擁有者刪除段落 "$太陽系簡介.id"                 # tests/features/steps/paragraph/commands/delete_paragraph.py:7
      Then 操作失敗，狀態碼為 401，錯誤代碼為 "UNAUTHORIZED"  # tests/features/steps/common_then/failure.py:4

  Rule: 前置（確認）- 刪除前必須顯示確認對話框，使用者主動確認後才執行刪除  # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:30

  Rule: 前置（存在）- 目標 Paragraph 必須存在  # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:33

    Example: 目標段落不存在時拒絕刪除                  # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:35
      Given 擁有者已登入                         # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/logged_in.py:11
      And 系統中有以下衛星：                        # tests/features/steps/satellite/aggregate_given/satellites.py:8
        | name | created_at       |
        | 天文   | 2026-01-01 00:00 |
      And 系統中有以下子衛星：                       # tests/features/steps/sub_satellite/aggregate_given/sub_satellites.py:8
        | satellite_id | name | created_at       |
        | $天文.id       | 星系   | 2026-02-01 00:00 |
      And 系統中有以下段落：                        # tests/features/steps/paragraph/aggregate_given/paragraphs.py:8
        | sub_satellite_id | title | content            | created_at       |
        | $星系.id           | 銀河系簡介 | <p>銀河系是一個棒旋星系。</p> | 2026-03-01 00:00 |
        | $星系.id           | 太陽系簡介 | <p>太陽系有八大行星。</p>   | 2026-03-02 00:00 |
      When 擁有者刪除段落 "99999"                 # tests/features/steps/paragraph/commands/delete_paragraph.py:7
      Then 操作失敗，狀態碼為 404，錯誤代碼為 "NOT_FOUND" # tests/features/steps/common_then/failure.py:4

  Rule: 後置（狀態）- 刪除成功後 Paragraph 從清單消失  # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:39

    Example: 刪除成功後消失，同一子衛星的其他段落不受影響  # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:41
      Given 擁有者已登入                   # tests/features/steps/auth/commands/logged_in.py:11
      And 系統中有以下衛星：                  # tests/features/steps/satellite/aggregate_given/satellites.py:8
        | name | created_at       |
        | 天文   | 2026-01-01 00:00 |
      And 系統中有以下子衛星：                 # tests/features/steps/sub_satellite/aggregate_given/sub_satellites.py:8
        | satellite_id | name | created_at       |
        | $天文.id       | 星系   | 2026-02-01 00:00 |
      And 系統中有以下段落：                  # tests/features/steps/paragraph/aggregate_given/paragraphs.py:8
        | sub_satellite_id | title | content            | created_at       |
        | $星系.id           | 銀河系簡介 | <p>銀河系是一個棒旋星系。</p> | 2026-03-01 00:00 |
        | $星系.id           | 太陽系簡介 | <p>太陽系有八大行星。</p>   | 2026-03-02 00:00 |
      When 擁有者刪除段落 "$太陽系簡介.id"       # tests/features/steps/paragraph/commands/delete_paragraph.py:7
      Then 操作成功                      # tests/features/steps/common_then/success.py:4
      And 系統中不應有段落 "太陽系簡介"           # tests/features/steps/paragraph/aggregate_then/paragraph_absent.py:6
      And 系統中應有以下段落：                 # tests/features/steps/paragraph/aggregate_then/paragraphs_exist.py:32
        | sub_satellite_id | title |
        | $星系.id           | 銀河系簡介 |

  Rule: 後置（錯誤）- 目標 Paragraph 不存在時回傳 404 Not Found  # tests/features/admin/paragraph/刪除段落.feature:49

@command
Feature: 新增段落 # tests/features/admin/paragraph/新增段落.feature:2

